   "no": 1,
   "en": "PROBLEM",
   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<p>同一速度绝对值在上提与下放时造成相反压差，且狭窄间隙会放大这种作用。</p><p>把起下钻速度的方向保留下来：下放对应激动增压，上提对应抽汲降压；观察间隙、井深和泥浆密度改变后的合成井底压力。 示例把相互作用拆成可见分量，重点观察变量方向、数量级与约束，而不是预设某个方案一定更好。</p><div class='figure'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 720 330' role='img' aria-label='01 · 同一井筒内，速度符号决定压差方向' style='font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif'><title>01 · 同一井筒内，速度符号决定压差方向</title><text x='24.00' y='27.00' font-size='17' fill='var(--ink,#24364b)' text-anchor='start'>01 · 同一井筒内，速度符号决定压差方向</text><rect x='75.00' y='68.00' width='100.00' height='180.00' rx='3' fill='#d58a45' fill-opacity='0.18'/><rect x='103.00' y='73.00' width='42.00' height='165.00' rx='3' fill='var(--ink-3,#62748a)' fill-opacity='0.32'/><path d='M123.00 103.00L123.00 200.00' fill='none' stroke='#bf6570' stroke-width='2.5'/><path d='M123.00 200.00L119.16 192.98' fill='none' stroke='#bf6570' stroke-width='2.5'/><path d='M123.00 200.00L126.84 192.98' fill='none' stroke='#bf6570' stroke-width='2.5'/><text x='123.00' y='268.00' font-size='15' fill='#bf6570' text-anchor='middle'>下钻 v &gt; 0</text><text x='180.00' y='139.00' font-size='14' fill='#bf6570' text-anchor='start'>激动 ΔP &gt; 0</text><text x='180.00' y='174.00' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#24364b)' text-anchor='start'>井底压力升高</text><rect x='415.00' y='68.00' width='100.00' height='180.00' rx='3' fill='#d58a45' fill-opacity='0.18'/><rect x='443.00' y='73.00' width='42.00' height='165.00' rx='3' fill='var(--ink-3,#62748a)' fill-opacity='0.32'/><path d='M463.00 200.00L463.00 103.00' fill='none' stroke='#3986c8' stroke-width='2.5'/><path d='M463.00 103.00L466.84 110.02' fill='none' stroke='#3986c8' stroke-width='2.5'/><path d='M463.00 103.00L459.16 110.02' fill='none' stroke='#3986c8' stroke-width='2.5'/><text x='463.00' y='268.00' font-size='15' fill='#3986c8' text-anchor='middle'>起钻 v &lt; 0</text><text x='520.00' y='139.00' font-size='14' fill='#3986c8' text-anchor='start'>抽汲 ΔP &lt; 0</text><text x='520.00' y='174.00' font-size='14' fill='var(--ink,#24364b)' text-anchor='start'>井底压力降低</text><text x='24.00' y='317.00' font-size='13' fill='var(--ink-3,#62748a)' text-anchor='start'>静态教学图 · 参数和计算口径与案例演示一致</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>图 1</b><span>约定向下为正。图中钻柱下行产生正激动压差，上行产生负抽汲压差；形状为方向示意，未求实际位移流场。</span></div>"
